Subject: [PATCH] Restore Codex Unleashed branding and build metadata

Keep the complete project URL on a separate line, align the fork label and URL under the title, and omit the label colon.

TDD: RUSTUP_HOME=/home/gili/codex-unleashed/worktrees/.rustup-release RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=1.95.0 CODEX_UNLEASHED_BUILD_NUMBER=18 cargo test -p codex-tui --lib session_header_keeps_full_url_at_narrow_widths fails before alignment (column 4 instead of 5), and passes after. cargo test -p codex-tui --lib session_header_ passes 11 tests after snapshot updates.
